GIS WORKFLOW DOCUMENTATION

Prepared by: Timotius Kurniawan
Date: May 2026

=== TECHNICAL DOCUMENTATION ===

Standardized GIS workflow for spatial data processing and analysis.

WORKFLOW OVERVIEW:
1. Data Collection & Validation
   - Source verification
   - Attribute integrity checks
   - Spatial accuracy validation

2. Data Processing
   - Georeferencing
   - Topology correction
   - Attribute standardization

3. Analysis & Synthesis
   - Spatial queries
   - Layer integration
   - Statistical analysis

4. Reporting & Visualization
   - Map production
   - Executive summary generation
   - Stakeholder presentation

TOOLS USED:
- ArcGIS Pro 3.x
- QGIS 3.32
- R (sf, sp, terra packages)

STANDARDS:
- WGS84 coordinate reference system
- Indonesian geospatial standards
- ISO 19100 series compliance

